; WDFLDR.SYS exports used by KMDF client stubs. Names from Microsoft's MIT fxldr.h
; (Windows-Driver-Frameworks src/framework/shared/inc/private/common/fxldr.h) and
; cross-checked against ReactOS wdfldr.spec. Not generated from a real ARM64 WDFLDR.SYS:
; regenerate with `petool.py defs-from-pe --pe WDFLDR.SYS` (see toolchain/README.md).
LIBRARY "WDFLDR.SYS"
EXPORTS
WdfLdrQueryInterface
WdfRegisterClassLibrary
WdfRegisterLibrary
WdfVersionBind
WdfVersionBindClass
WdfVersionUnbind
WdfVersionUnbindClass
